c5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2024-10-23T18:18:04Z","updated_at":"2024-10-24T14:09:24Z","closed_at":"2024-10-24T14:09:02Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98468","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98468","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98468.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98468.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- Requires #89950\r\n- Requires #98439\r\n\r\nOne of the additions to C++20 is the new type `char8_t`[^1], functioning as the UTF-8 equivalent to `char16_t` and `char32_t`. Despite being a C++20 feature, this type can be safely backported to C++17 using `-fchar8_t` (`/Zc:char8_t` on msvc). While this exists with the intent to replace `char` with `char8_t` in UTF-8 contexts, that would be a *very* wide-reaching change which would necessitate a more granular approach. Instead, this simply extends character-type support introduced in the above two PRs to include `char8_t`.\r\n\r\n[^1]: https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/types#char8_t","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rep